//// styled — the base for building CSS components (decision 338).
////
//// `styled "…"` (the default module's `pub default fn`) and
//// `styledProperty "…"` answer `@Component<…>` values; the
//// layered `Sheet` holds them in `@layer`s; the theme mechanism (`Theme`,
//// `entry`, `clear`, `clearNs`, `clearAll`, `extendTheme`, `#[theme]`) is
//// what `@variant md` and `--theme(…)` read. It imports `css` and `std`, and
//// knows no file kind, no markup and no framework.
////
//// Modules are listed so a module precedes the siblings that import it.

pub mod hash;
pub mod theme;
pub mod variants;
pub mod reader;
pub mod layers;
pub default mod styled;
